what is @Transactional in spring jpa?
Exception(checked) thrown but data still commits.why?
Default Spring @Transactional behavior (VERY important)

If you do NOT specify any rollback attributes:

❌ Transaction will ROLL BACK if:

RuntimeException

Unchecked exception

Error

✅ Transaction will COMMIT if:

Checked exception (Exception, IOException, SQLException, etc.)
